-	 * may be accessed safely. If @mm_ok is false, the process MM was
-	 * already gone; skip the userspace write.
+	 * (copy_to_user, etc.) may be accessed safely.
+	 * If @mm_ok is false, the process MM was already gone; skip the
+	 * userspace write.
